"r":[0.125,0.5148,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Emilie","r":[0.1685,0.5148,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.212,0.5148,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Raiden Shogun","r":[0.125,0.5674,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Kujou Sara","r":[0.1685,0.5674,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Chevreuse","r":[0.212,0.5674,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Wriothesley","r":[0.125,0.62,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.1685,0.62,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.212,0.62,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Mualani","r":[0.125,0.6793,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Xilonen","r":[0.1685,0.6793,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Sucrose","r":[0.212,0.6793,0.0361,0.0289]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/travelerpyro/261111-225334/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Exaiphanes Blade","text":"Best all-round option: strong ER and team-neutral particles when Pyro Traveler crits on-field."},{"name":"Freedom-Sworn","text":"Premium EM sword with an additional teamwide attack buff after triggering reactions."},{"name":"Favonius Sword","text":"EM adds reaction DMG while the passive gives Pyro Traveler and allies ER."},{"name":"Xiphos' Moonlight","text":"At R5, a Skill reset can support shorter rotations; otherwise less consistent than Favonius. Primarily for ~16-second rotations. R5 strongly preferred."},{"name":"Sacrificial Sword","text":"Provides ER and improves Skill damage. A good legacy option when Favonius particles are unnecessary. Past limited event; unavailable to new players."},{"name":"Festering Desire","text":"Fishing sword grants ER and temporary post-Skill ER, helping a budget support Burst consistently."},{"name":"Fleuve Cendre Ferryman","text":"Craftable EM sword for Burgeon or Overloaded triggering after meeting Burst energy needs. Reaction-trigger setup; little help with ER."},{"name":"Iron Sting","text":"Craftable ER option; its EM leaf buff is conditional on triggering Dendro-related reactions. Best with Burning or Burgeon; ally must collect the leaf."}],"a":[{"names":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"text":"Best general support set: Nightsoul-aligned Pyro reactions grant large Elemental DMG buffs to relevant team elements.","stats":"ER · Pyro DMG/ATK% · CRIT Rate (Fav)"},{"names":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"text":"Skill hits maintain the team ATK buff when Scroll is already assigned to another support.","stats":"ER · HP%/Pyro DMG · CRIT Rate (Fav)"},{"names":["Deepwood Memories"],"text":"For Kinich/Emilie Burning teams when no teammate holds Deepwood; reduces enemy Dendro RES.","stats":"ER · Pyro DMG/ATK% · CRIT Rate (Fav)"}],"t":[{"name":"Wildfire Vanguard","members":["Traveler (Pyro)","Kinich","Emilie","Bennett"],"text":"Maintains Burning for Kinich and Emilie. Equip Traveler with Deepwood if nobody else uses it; Bennett buffs Kinich.","roles":["Pyro Enabler / Support","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Overload Patrol","members":["Traveler (Pyro)","Raiden Shogun","Kujou Sara","Chevreuse"],"text":"Off-field Pyro sustains Overloaded for Chevreuse; Sara boosts Raiden. Scroll on Traveler provides team buffs.","roles":["Pyro Enabler / Support","On-field DPS / Battery","ATK Buffer","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Frostfire Relay","members":["Traveler (Pyro)","Wriothesley","Nahida","Bennett"],"text":"Nahida helps sustain Burning so Wriothesley can Melt; Traveler adds Pyro and Scroll buffs. Pyro alone is not enough.","roles":["Pyro Enabler / Support","On-field DPS","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Shark-Fin Spark","members":["Traveler (Pyro)","Mualani","Xilonen","Sucrose"],"text":"A precise single-target Vape setup for Mualani; Traveler’s slow Pyro can struggle in multi-target encounters. Scroll may be redundant.","roles":["Pyro Enabler / Support","On-field DPS","Healer / Debuffer","EM Buffer / Debuffer"]}],"v":"Scroll Support: 4pc Scroll and Favonius: prioritize ER and reliable Pyro reactions to buff teammates.\nKinich Burning: 4pc Deepwood if absent elsewhere; sustain Burning for Kinich and Emilie.\nBurgeon Trigger: 4pc Flower of Paradise Lost, EM weapon, level 90; reach ER needs before stacking EM.\nC6 On-Field: 4pc Obsidian Codex, Pyro DMG/CRIT; Pyro-infused attacks only during Nightsoul Blessing.\nBurst Nuke: Invest Burst, CRIT and ATK; Vaporize or Melt the initial hit with proper enemy aura.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Support / Sub DPS"],"about":"Pyro Traveler supplies off-field Pyro through their Nightsoul Skill and boosts teammates with C1 and Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City. Tap Skill follows melee allies; Hold Skill targets enemies for ranged teams. Their Pyro application is slow.","pros":["Free off-field Pyro","Excellent Scroll user","C1 buffs active allies","Flexible tap/hold Skill"],"cons":["Slow Pyro application","Limited multi-target coverage","High Burst ER needs","Low personal damage"],"weapons":["Exaiphanes Blade","Freedom-Sworn","Favonius Sword","Xiphos' Moonlight","Sacrificial Sword","Festering Desire","Fleuve Cendre Ferryman","Iron Sting"],"arts":[{"sets":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Deepwood Memories"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["Energy Recharge","Pyro DMG / ATK%","CRIT Rate (Favonius) / CRIT DMG"],"stats":["Energy Recharge: 210% - 235% (Fav, typical support)","ER: 160% - 220% (energy-rich teams)","ER: 255% - 300% (low-energy, non-Fav)","CRIT Rate: 40% - 60% (Favonius only)","Elemental Mastery: 700+ (Burgeon alternative)"],"vars":[{"title":"Kinich Burning Support","role":"Off-field Support","weapons":["Favonius Sword","Fleuve Cendre Ferryman"],"arts":[{"sets":["Deepwood Memories"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Prioritize ER to Burst consistently; CRIT Rate if using Favonius.","teams":"Kinich plus Dendro/Burning; put Deepwood on Traveler only if nobody else carries it.","when":"Use to maintain Burning and shred Dendro RES while Kinich and Emilie deal damage.","cond":"Deepwood effect must be maintained on targets.","notes":"","pre":fal